[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  "不像[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "沮授", "cat": "people"}]沮授[/url][/color][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "田丰", "cat": "people"}]田丰[/url][/color]为理念殉道，不像[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "郭嘉", "cat": "people"}]郭嘉[/url][/color]诸葛贪恋功名；阎圃的智慧在于知进退、善保全"[/indent]
